+ StaticScaleCell is Box

+ index Size
+ color RGBA = "#0e7490"

• This • scale-cell w:15 h:15

────────────────────
+ This
    - index

color = static-scale-cell-color(index)

────────────────────
+ do paint-background
    - canvas Canvas

canvas.push()
canvas.fill-color = color
canvas.stroke-color = null
canvas.rect(bounds)
canvas.pop()

